19"},{"q":"What is worth doing in Jackson Hole?","a":"**A winter Elk Refuge sleigh ride + wildlife safari** — a horse-drawn sleigh among thousands of wintering elk, plus guided valley wildlife tours — a signature Jackson winter adventure off the slopes — TIMING: winter — **PRICE TIER `[comfort]`** — COMMISSION: outfitter/venue 10-15%","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Elk_Refuge","accessed":"2026-07-19"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Jackson Hole Ski Guide: Big Red, Corbet''s Couloir & the Tetons, Wyoming","meta_description":"Plan Jackson Hole Mountain Resort, Wyoming - America''s steepest legend on the Ikon Pass: the 100-passenger Aerial Tram (''Big Red'') to a 4,139-ft vertical, Corbet''s Couloir, ~50% expert terrain, an independent Teton Village base between Grand Teton and Yellowstone, reached by the only airport inside a US national park - with real timing, altitude/avalanche safety and booking intel.","slug":"jackson-hole-wyoming","primary_keyword":"Jackson Hole ski travel guide","long_tail":["Jackson Hole Aerial Tram Big Red","ski Corbet''s Couloir Jackson Hole","Jackson Hole vs Teton Village where to stay","Jackson Hole Ikon Pass reservations","fly into Jackson Hole Airport ski","Granite Hot Springs winter day trip"],"search_language":"es-US","local_keywords":["guia de esqui Jackson Hole Wyoming","teleferico Big Red Jackson Hole","esquiar Corbet''s Couloir","Jackson Hole Ikon Pass reservaciones","hoteles de lujo Teton Village","aguas termales Granite Hot Springs invierno"],"hreflang":["en","es-US"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-19","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-19","last_verifie