dded-capable). draw_rank 1.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Killington_Ski_Resort","accessed":"2026-07-19"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Killington Ski Guide: The Beast of the East & the Longest Season, Vermont","meta_description":"Plan Killington Resort, Vermont - ''The Beast of the East'' on the Ikon Pass: six peaks, 1,509 acres and New England''s biggest vertical (3,050 ft), the longest season in the East (October to May/June on Superstar), the Stifel Killington Cup World Cup at Thanksgiving, and the Killington Road apres scene - with real timing, Eastern-ice/cold safety and booking intel.","slug":"killington-vermont","primary_keyword":"Killington Vermont ski travel guide","long_tail":["Beast of the East ski resort","Killington longest ski season October to June","Stifel Killington Cup World Cup Thanksgiving","Killington Ikon Pass Beast 365","Killington Road apres nightlife","ski Killington from Boston drive"],"search_language":"es-US","local_keywords":["guia de esqui Killington Vermont","la Bestia del Este estacion de esqui","temporada de esqui mas larga del este","Copa del Mundo Killington Vermont","Killington pase Ikon","vida nocturna apres-ski Killington Road"],"hreflang":["en","es-US"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-19","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-19","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/usa","read":"2026-08-20T14:47:42Z","source_updated":"2026-08-18T10:29:04+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":[],"advisory_verified":"2026-07-19","note":"US domestic, lowest-risk t